  "The field is quiet — speak once more": "Fusha është e qetë — fol edhe njëherë",
  "The field received the spread but could not complete the reading.": "Fusha mori shtrirjen, por nuk arriti ta përfundojë leximin.",
  "The field received your question but could not complete the transmission.": "Fusha mori pyetjen tënde, por nuk arriti ta përfundojë transmetimin.",
  "The field the chat wears": "Fusha që mban biseda",
